### Platform administration, P14 (StoreForge staff). Needs a platform admin row (runbook: platform-admin.md)
### and accessToken from http/auth.http (password login).

@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Enroll an authenticator (once): import otpauthUri into the app (QR code or paste the secret)
POST {{base}}/platform/v1/mfa/enrollment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Confirm with the first code: returns 10 recovery codes, shown ONCE
POST {{base}}/platform/v1/mfa/enrollment/confirmation
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "123456"}

### 3. Step up: a 15-minute platform token (each code works once)
POST {{base}}/platform/v1/session
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "123456"}

> {% client.global.set("platformToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Stores
GET {{base}}/platform/v1/stores?q=acme&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Suspend a store (storefront and APIs go offline; written to the store's own audit log)
POST {{base}}/platform/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/suspension
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Card testing through checkout, ticket #123"}

### Reinstate
POST {{base}}/platform/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/reinstatement
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Resolved with the merchant"}

### Job queue, and requeue a DEAD job
GET {{base}}/platform/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### Platform audit log
GET {{base}}/platform/v1/audit?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
